      <title>Pitch | HU Entrepreneurial Program</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53737982856760/huge/c74e8043c536e0be027cf48245fbcbdc7f2d2818.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Sun, 23 Aug 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>Offered by the HU Tech Transfer Office - Pitch|HU is a six-week entrepreneurial program that equips participants with National Science Foundation (NSF) I-Corps customer discovery tools &amp; commercialization strategies to transform ideas into market-ready solutions.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>Have an idea, innovation, research project, creative work, or solution with real-world potential? This is your invitation to take it further.
<br> </p>

<p>Pitch|HU welcomes Howard faculty, staff, students, alumni, HBCU affiliates, and innovators from our surrounding communities to participate in a six-week entrepreneurial experience designed to help turn ideas into commercial pathways, ventures, and impact.
<br> </p>

